   <div class="detailWrap">
    <div class="detail-area">
     <p style="margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm"><img alt="" src="/images/pages/upload_image/news/news_634.png" loading="lazy"></p>
     <p style="margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm">&nbsp;</p>
     <p style="margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black">A shining journey of golden years, filled with achievements and “Thélicious”memories. Every moment of laughter and joy is like our Golden Bubbles, solid and full. Thank YOU for creating brilliance with us.</span></span></p>
     <p style="margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm"><br><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black"><strong>Competition Overview:</strong></span></span></p>
     <p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black">-Design a 2026 KOI20th anniversary logo centered around "A Bubbling Golden Era".</span></span></p>
     <p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black">-Deadline: February 28, 2025</span></span></p>
     <p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black">-Eligibility: Open to KOI fans worldwide. Participants may submit multiple entries, individually or in teams.</span></span></p>
     <p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black">-Design Requirements: Design style is open; hand-drawing, digital art, and any format <strong>except AI-generated images </strong>are welcome.</span></span></p>
     <p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black">-Submission Format: JPG format, A4 size (21cm x 29.7cm) or larger, with a minimum resolution of 300dpi. Submit entries to events@@koicafe.com.</span></span></p>
     <p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black">-Email Title Format: KOI20_LOGO_Your Name_Country</span></span></p>
     <p style="margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm"><br><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black"><strong>Selection Process:</strong></span></span></p>
     <p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black">-Selection Date: March 2025</span></span></p>
     <p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black">-Evaluation Criteria: Theme relevance 40%, originality 30%, and expressiveness 30%</span></span><br>
       &nbsp;</p>
     <p style="margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black"><strong>Prizes:</strong></span></span></p>
     <p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black">-Announcement of Winners: March 2025</span></span></p>
     <p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black">-Gold Dot Award: One winner will receive 200 KOI drink vouchers and a trophy.</span></span></p>
     <p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black">-Honorable Award: Up to five winners will receive 20 KOI drink vouchers, exclusive gifts, and certificates.</span></span></p>
     <p><br><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black"><strong>Contest Declaration：</strong></span></span></p>
     <p style="margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black">1. The entries submitted must be the original works of the entrants and do not infringe any patents, copyrights, trademarks, and other intellectual property rights of anyone else. The entries have not been published in newspapers, magazines, websites, and other media, has not applied for patents or registered copyrights, has not participated in other competitions, and has not entered commercial channels in any form. The organizer shall not bear the legal responsibility arising from the infringement of the rights of others (or units) by the work, and the legal responsibility shall be borne by the participant.</span></span></p>
     <p style="margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black">2. The copyright of the winning entries belongs to the organizer, and it has exclusive ownership including but not limited to the following ways to exercise copyright: enjoy the right to redesign, produce, sell, display, and publicize the work plan, and the winning participants must fill in the "Work Copyright Ownership Agreement”.</span></span></p>
     <p style="margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black">3. If the entry does not meet the judging criteria, the prize will be vacant.</span></span></p>
     <p style="margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:black">4. The organizer reserves the right of final interpretation of this event.</span></span></p>
